        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1984-06-22/pdf/FR-1984-06-22.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. M aintaining C onditions. As provided by Section 9A(c) of the Act, as  \namended, from the date of the creation of the board, and for 120 days  \nthereafter, no change, except by agreement of the parties, shall be made by  \nthe carrier or the employees in the conditions out of which the dispute arose."
    },
